<%@ Page Title="" Language="C#" MasterPageFile="~/Site.Master" AutoEventWireup="true" CodeBehind="About.aspx.cs" Inherits="SGIPC_Portfolio.About1" %>
<asp:Content ID="Content1" ContentPlaceHolderID="Head" runat="server">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="style/About.css" />
</asp:Content>
<asp:Content ID="Content2" ContentPlaceHolderID="body" runat="server">
    <div class="banner">
        <h1>About SGIPC:</h1>
<h1>Our Mission & Legacy</h1>
    </div>

    <section>
        <div class="about-div">
            <h2 id="heading">The Heart of Competitive Excellence</h2>
            <p id="about"><i>
                Founded at KUET to transform casual coding into a high-level discipline, SGIPC has grown from a passionate
                study circle into a powerhouse of technical talent. Historically, the group was created to meet
                the rising demand for advanced algorithmic skills that standard curricula often overlook. 
                Over the years, we have evolved our training from simple peer discussions into a structured
                mentorship ecosystem that analyzes global competitive trends to keep our students ahead.
                Today, SGIPC stands as a bridge between academic learning and the professional tech world,
                consistently developing the problem-solving resilience and teamwork necessary to succeed on
                the international stage.</i>
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <div class="mission-div">
            <h3 id="mission-head">Mission and Vission</h3>
            <div class="mission">
                <div>
                    <p><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i>Cultivating Competitive Excellence</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    
                    <p>Our primary mission is to identify and nurture top-tier programming talent. We provide the resources and training necessary for students to excel in prestigious global platforms like the ICPC, national contests, and online platforms</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            <div class="mission">
                <div>
                    <p><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i>Peer-Driven Mentorship</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    
                    <p>We believe in the power of community learning. Through organized training camps and regular problem-solving sessions, our senior members and alumni mentor juniors, ensuring a continuous legacy of knowledge transfer.</p>
                </div>
                

            </div>
            <div class="mission">
                <div>
                    <p><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i>Mastery of Algorithms & Logic</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    
                    <p>Beyond the scoreboard, we value deep technical proficiency. We are dedicated to strengthening students' foundations in Data Structures, Algorithms, and Mathematics, equipping them for complex real-world engineering challenges</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            <div class="mission">
                <div>
                    <p><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i>Collaborative Problem Solving</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    
                    <p>Success in programming is rarely a solo journey. We foster a collaborative environment where teamwork, resilience, and a "growth mindset" are central, building a tight-knit community of developers and thinkers.</p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    

</asp:Content>
